        "action_date": "2025-02-21",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Air Traffic Noise and Pollution Expert Consensus Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Federal Aviation Administration to enter into an arrangement with the National Academies of Sciences, Engineering, and Medicine to examine and report on the various health impacts of air traffic noise and pollution.</p>",
